    "name": "Weapon Meister",
    "steam_appid": 2455790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455790/extras/af02560a986fbb926ef5b918b53f4850.avif?t=1706263434\" /></span><br><br>The plot of <strong>Weapon Meister</strong> takes you back to 200 years before the grim events of the game <strong>Unferat</strong> where the player took on the role of the villainous Necromancer.<br><br>This time you are offered the opposite role and play as a recruit of the holy Order confronting the first Necromancer and his evil horde.<br>Moving from field to field, you will collect skill cards, combine them, upgrade your weapons, trade and master the talent system.<br>Hordes of enemies will stand in your way!<br>The living dead with unique characteristics and skills! <br>Fast and ruthless robbers! Warding magic monoliths! Cultists using dark magic!<br><br>Greed and hastiness will inevitably result in defeat.<br>Learn to use the strengths of each weapon and create deadly fighting combos!<br>Declare that strategy is worth more than numerical advantage, then prove it on the battlefield!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455790/extras/a1b826406b6c05d62f068bc514c2e20c.avif?t=1706263434\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455790/extras/af02560a986fbb926ef5b918b53f4850.avif?t=1706263434\" /></span><br><br>The plot of <strong>Weapon Meister</strong> takes you back to 200 years before the grim events of the game <strong>Unferat</strong> where the player took on the role of the villainous Necromancer.<br><br>This time you are offered the opposite role and play as a recruit of the holy Order confronting the first Necromancer and his evil horde.<br>Moving from field to field, you will collect skill cards, combine them, upgrade your weapons, trade and master the talent system.<br>Hordes of enemies will stand in your way!<br>The living dead with unique characteristics and skills! <br>Fast and ruthless robbers! Warding magic monoliths! Cultists using dark magic!<br><br>Greed and hastiness will inevitably result in defeat.<br>Learn to use the strengths of each weapon and create deadly fighting combos!<br>Declare that strategy is worth more than numerical advantage, then prove it on the battlefield!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455790/extras/a1b826406b6c05d62f068bc514c2e20c.avif?t=1706263434\" /></span>",
